# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback (ADR-0043 §1). The enrollment and visitor pages are exported as
# a single placeholder shell each (generateStaticParams token "_"); serve that shell for every
# /e/<id> and /v/<token>, and let the client read the real id/token from the path. Status 200 =
# rewrite (URL unchanged), not a redirect. /api/* is served by Pages Functions, which take
# precedence over these rules, so it is intentionally not listed here.
/e/*  /e/_  200
/v/*  /v/_  200
